        "text": "Today was my first time at Regal nails in the vaudreuil Walmart and I am so happy to say I have found my new nail salon!! I showed them a picture of what I wanted and they exceeded my expectations! The end result looks exactly like the picture :) they are very friendly and nice as well, the salon is very clean and the nails are just perfect and so well done. I cant wait to go back for my refill in 2-3 weeks! Thanks again guys!! ♥️ See you soon :)",
